<title>FRANCE: Netanyahu to Strasbourg Euro forum Jan 30.</title>
<headline>Netanyahu to Strasbourg Euro forum Jan 30.</headline>
<dateline>STRASBOURG, France 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli Prime Minister Benyamin Netanyahu will address the Council of Europe's parliamentary assembly in Strasbourg on January 30, the body said on Thursday.</p>
<p>No further details on his appearance were immediately available.</p>
